t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$75,000 (For the <a href=\"/wiki/Grabbiest_Grabber\" title=\"Grabbiest Grabber\">Grabbiest Grabber</a>) &amp; 30.00 USD for the real plush.</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Allows you to pick up even more objects at once for longer, and with a slightly increased range.</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.67.5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><big><i>\"Based upon the REAL LIFE Grabbiest Grabber you can get from <span style=\"color:#f8186d\">Lootbloc!</span> Check them out for all sorts of real life Oaklands merchandise!<br /><br /></i>\nHarnessing the true ultimate power of plushiness... with magic, unicorns, rainbows, and fabric. What a delight!\"</big>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Plushiest Grabber</b> is a tool that was obtained by taking the <a href=\"/wiki/Grabbiest_Grabber\" title=\"Grabbiest Grabber\">Grabbiest Grabber</a> and placing it in the middle of <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a> causing it to turn into the Plushiest Grabber.\nIt emits a faint blue glow when equipped and makes a squeaking noise whenever you use it. It's pick up area also displays as a rounded square rather than the typical circle seen with every other grabber. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"97d6c687f0b22f55f40053fadd805a61\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Center_of_Alan-s_Autologistics-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:152px; width:185px; top:16.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Center_of_Alan%27s_Autologistics.png\" title=\"Center of Alan&#39;s Autologistics.png (1.41 MB)\" style=\"height:152px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c4/Center_of_Alan%27s_Autologistics.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240926225630\" title=