Plushiest Grabber in real life</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Lootbloc teamed up with Oaklands and is selling a real Plushie of the <a href=\"/wiki/Grabbiest_Grabber\" title=\"Grabbiest Grabber\">Grabbiest Grabber</a> for a limited time.</li>\n<li>The plushiest grabber was limited to the Lootbloc plush sale, and can no longer be naturally obtained.</li>\n<li>Link for <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Plushiest Grabber</strong> - <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://lootbloc.com/products/oaklands-grabbiest-grabber-plushie\">https://lootbloc.com/products/oaklands-grabbiest-grabber-plushie</a>.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902114915\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 74/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 55/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6671/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019490/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.539      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   31.539      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3290-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902114915 and revision id 19339. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tools","Grabbers"],"links":[{"title":"Alan's AutoLogistics","exists":true},{"title":"Finlay Island","exists":true},{"title":"Grabbiest Grabber","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true}],"images":["Plushiest_Grabber.png","Center_of_Alan's_Autologistics.png","Grabbiest_Grabber_plushie_AD_1.png","Grabbies